  "prefLabel": "Env-Or 604.09 Potential Discharges Impacting Indoor Air Quality",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Or 604.09 Potential Discharges Impacting Indoor Air Quality. In addition to all other requirements described in this chapter, the responsible party or any other person who becomes aware of a potential discharge of a regulated contaminant to soil or groundwater based on an indoor air quality assessment shall notify the department within 24 hours of obtaining quantitative data identifying indoor air impacts.\n\nSource. #14159, eff 12-25-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-or600.html"
